 100 yokai.</strong><br><strong>Form your ultimate Hyakki Yagy\u014d, master deep strategy, and conquer deadly encounters!</strong><br>Challenge yourself in a battle-focused, high-difficulty RPG\u2014no exploration, just pure tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for players seeking high-difficulty and challenging battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A powerless onmyoji leads a hundred yokai into battle\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Hyakuyoushi&quot;</i> is a command-based strategy RPG with a deep tactical core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow <strong>Sei</strong>, a young onmyoji who has lost her spiritual power, and the twin nine-tailed foxes <strong>Kuro</strong> and <strong>Shiro</strong>, as they embark on a journey to reclaim her lost arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1764062978\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/9f43d52f53a8fca1c06895d7641a11dc.avif?t=1764062978\" width=224 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl without onmy\u014d arts\u2014Haru.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without pacts nor mystical talent,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she faced the youkai simply as a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind her carefree smile lies a will stronger than any spell.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with a hundred allies at her side,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the false onmy\u014dji tears through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1764062978\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/90133bf359562cbfcba65cb8a2eb4e07.avif?t=1764062978\" width=224 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D\u014dman, the archenemy who cursed Haru\u2019s master to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A genius of orthodox onmy\u014d arts,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he tramples youkai with elegance and cruelty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To him, battle is beauty\u2014and mockery, his art.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Haru, this &quot;embodiment of curses&quot; stands as the ultimate wall she must break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/07de772e255f646251e68705d613d30a.webp?t=1764062978\" width=680 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose 4 yokai from a pool of 100, each with their own attributes, skills, and combo techniques, to form your ultimate party.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All yokai can grow strong with proper training\u2014build your own unbeatable Hyakki Yagy\u014d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is turn-based and highly strategic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory hinges on skill order, buffs/debuffs, formation choices, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no exploration or mini-games, this title focuses entirely on combat, delivering a fast-paced and concentrated tactical experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654060/extras/